  "content": "<h3><strong>所有资产均受CC BY-NC-ND 4.0许可条款约束，详见此链接&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-nd%252f4.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/</a></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong><br>Suffuse GunSmoke</strong><em> <strong>(SGS</strong> for short)</em>是TACZ Timeless and Classics Zero的一个扩展包。通过引入来自世界各地的一些经典枪械以及一些不太知名的武器来扩充你的武器库，提供更丰富的游戏体验。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>加入我们的官方社区以抢先查看即将推出的内容!<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#0014ff\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fnVRGnTrNYK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061140/description_12e075b5-0822-404d-80e1-715e13b182bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"264\" height=\"60\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fSuffuseGunSmoke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061140/description_00e2d002-bf82-4262-91ed-462233264414.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"189\" height=\"60\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f425431507\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061140/description_ced51011-30ac-4b6e-ad32-cf75cc37bf38.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"144\" height=\"60\"></a></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>包括:&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>10把突击步枪</li>\n<li>&nbsp;7把狙击步枪</li>\n<li>6把手枪</li>\n<li>6件重型武器</li>\n<li>...and more! (随着未来的更新)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>图像展示：</h3>\n<p><img><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061140/description_a3ce84a9-c83a-40d0-8f92-a1ae1c5eb292.png\" width=\"388\" height=\"129\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061140/description_ae133a31-750f-45d8-9431-4933f8da542c.png\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061140/description_fd561cda-dcf7-4004-910a-db2f27310fc7.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_20393031-b8ed-41b0-897e-03fc3c9a530b.png\"></p>\n<p>注意：<br><strong>未经授权的修改和分发本软件包是被严格禁止的。</strong></p>\n<p><br>最后的愿望：<br><em><strong>这是一个由众多才华横溢的创作者精心制作的模组。我们真心希望您能喜欢这个模组并享受游戏时光。</strong></em></h2>\n<h2><strong>如何使用它?</strong></h2>\n<p>打开你的Minecraft游戏文件夹，找到<strong>\"tacz\"</strong>文件夹。<br>把你下载的.zip文件放进去(无需解压缩)。<br>在游戏中使用命令\"/tacz reload\"加载它就可以了。<br>如果出现问题，只需重新启动游戏即可解决。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><em>感谢Rzen1th这位音响设计师，他因Polyarms和Urban Coalition Gmod插件而著名，部分音效素材归功于他。</em></h5>",
